            <ArticleTitle>Safety alert for fentanyl buccal tablets.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>47</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>On September 13, 2007, the United States Food and Drug Administration posted a safety alert for fentanyl buccal tablets (Fentora). The announcement and hyperlinks to the Dear Doctor and Dear Healthcare Professional Letters that were distributed by the sponsor are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
